  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Cook the rigatoni pasta according to package instructions until al dente.",
    "In a large bowl, toss the cooked rigatoni pasta with olive oil, cherry tomatoes, Kalamata olives, artichoke hearts, salt, and pepper.",
    "Transfer the pasta mixture to a 9x13 inch baking dish and top with chopped fresh basil.",
    "Drizzle the lemon juice over the top of the pasta mixture.",
    "Roast in the preheated oven for 15 minutes, or until the top is lightly browned.",
    "Remove from the oven and let cool for a few minutes before serving.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy."
